        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10031801": {
            "id": "10031801",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "You've finally returned. How was your journey to Jueyun Karst?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031802"
            ]
          },
          "10031802": {
            "id": "10031802",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "...I see."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "100318",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10031803"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10031803": {
            "id": "10031803",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Moon Carver, Mountain Shaper, Cloud Retainer, Conqueror of Demons...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031804"
            ]
          },
          "10031804": {
            "id": "10031804",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Some of these names have never come up in the intel the Fatui gets hold of.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031805"
            ]
          },
          "10031805": {
            "id": "10031805",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "As a returning gift, I too have information for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031809"
            ]
          },
          "10031809": {
            "id": "10031809",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Regarding the archon's passing... The Liyue Qixing's response really has given me food for thought...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031810"
            ]
          },
          "10031810": {
            "id": "10031810",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "They've announced that, as the true killer has not yet been found, they are not allowing anyone to pay their respects to the Exuvia.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031811"
            ]
          },
          "10031811": {
            "id": "10031811",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "They've even gone so far as to try and cut off information... But with the Rite of Descension and all, even the Qixing isn't able to keep a lid on things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031812"
            ]
          },
          "10031812": {
            "id": "10031812",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Exuvia?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031813"
            ]
          },
          "10031813": {
            "id": "10031813",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "It's common knowledge in Liyue that Rex Lapis is also an adeptus.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031814"
            ]
          },
          "10031814": {
            "id": "10031814",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "The Geo Archon is also the God of Contracts, and is also known as the Exuvia, Prime of the Adepti.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031815"
            ]
          },
          "10031815": {
            "id": "10031815",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "The mighty and illuminated adepti of today all signed contracts to protect Liyue way back then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031816"
            ]
          },
          "10031816": {
            "id": "10031816",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Guess that explains why they're all so focused on Liyue's well-being.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031817"
            ]
          },
          "10031817": {
            "id": "10031817",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Naturally. They both have the responsibility and the aptitude for the job.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031818"
            ]
          },
          "10031818": {
            "id": "10031818",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "If the ruling Qixing became unable to perform their duty properly, the adepti have the right to take corrective action.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031819"
            ]
          },
          "10031819": {
            "id": "10031819",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "The Geo Archon's spirit has risen, so why would the Qixing hide his vessel? Truly suspicious.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031822"
            ]
          },
          "10031822": {
            "id": "10031822",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh! Right! He's the whole reason we came here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031823"
            ]
          },
          "10031823": {
            "id": "10031823",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If the Liyue Qixing has locked up Exuvia and won't let anyone near...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031824"
            ]
          },
          "10031824": {
            "id": "10031824",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Then {NICKNAME}'s quest to find The Seven is already over!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031825"
            ]
          },
          "10031825": {
            "id": "10031825",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Oh? You're trying to find The Seven? And just why might that be, pray tell?"
          },
          "10031806": {
            "id": "10031806",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Oh, you didn't get to see all the adepti yourself? ...Well, as they say, it's up to fate, no?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031807"
            ]
          },
          "10031807": {
            "id": "10031807",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Not to worry! If you have the free time, there's no harm in giving it a go again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10031808"
            ]
          },
          "10031808": {
            "id": "10031808",
            "speakerId": 10200,
            "speakerName": "Childe",
            "text": "Besides, the information on the Conqueror of Demons is already very valuable. As a returning gift, I too have information for you."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}